  "notes": [
    "Stem-changing -IR verb with e→ie in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras)",
    "In pretérito indefinido, 3rd person singular and plural show e→i: *prefirió, prefirieron* (characteristic of -IR stem-changing verbs)",
    "Subjuntivo nosotros uses e→i (not e→ie): *prefiramos*",
    "Past participle: preferido (regular)",
    "*Prefiero el café al té* = I prefer coffee to tea",
    "*¿Qué prefieres, playa o montaña?* = Which do you prefer, the beach or the mountains?",
    "Related: la preferencia (preference), preferido/a (favourite/preferred), mejor (better)"
  ],
